    "Written by hand from the rules in CLAUDE.md. Never generate this from the validator's output.",
    "\"pass\" means every check passes. Otherwise, status is the file's overall result and because lists every check that is a warning or fail.",
    "confirmedOnHardware lists the products on which this result has been seen on a real board. A rule is only confirmed when this says so.",
    "Note: underscore separators warn on Tsunami because only a hyphen is documented for it so far (open question 2 for Jamie)."
